<!--
  The open folder's front flap: the same shape, lower, so more of the back plate
  shows above it.

  Open is read from the gap, not from a perspective trick. A sheared front reads
  as "open" on a 256px preview and as a smudge at 16, and 16 is the size a file
  listing actually uses.
-->
